        "id": 105388,
        "name": "Karrde",
        "username": "Karrde",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c0e974/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-01T02:05:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As far as I understand, scrapped cards never make their way back into your deck. Cards can only get back in play by being recycled, and those specifically say on them to recycle. So the majority of boosts and techs are gone from play for good (unless they make their way back into a station deck) once played. This goes hand in hand with recquisition cards being placed on the bottom of&nbsp;the deck to keep your deck from being totally depleted.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's very different from SotM in this regard in that you only have one living deck that you play with.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:34:58.714Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
